@name     pattern_queue
@alias    zq
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_pattern_queue
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  queue pattern start or stop at boundary
@doc
Queues active pattern state change at next bar boundary.
Usage: zq mode (or pattern_queue mode)
@code
    return skode_exec_zq(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
